    "OPPO 兼容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPPO Compatible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPPO 兼容恢复 OPPO 兼容结构、元数据和尾部数据；Apple 标准保留 Apple 照片结果且不写入 OPPO 私有信息，可按开关恢复可见原机水印。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPPO Compatible restores the OPPO-compatible structure, metadata and tail data; Apple Standard keeps the Apple Photos result without OPPO private data and can restore the visible original watermark via the toggle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPPO 兼容输出必须保留 OPPO 原始照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPPO Compatible output requires keeping the original OPPO photo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPPO 原始照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPPO original"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPPO 原始照片 → Apple 编辑副本 → iPhone 编辑 → 写回原机水印与元数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPPO original → Apple edit copy → edit on iPhone → write back watermark and metadata"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPPO 条目": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OPPO entries"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rust 内核": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rust core"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rust 内核 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rust core %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一帧影像，动用两台手机": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One photo, two phones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次摄影风格转换生成 Apple 编辑副本，在 iPhone 上编辑后回传，由 Rust 恢复原机水印与 OPPO 元数据。普通批量转换队列不参与此流程。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One Photographic Styles conversion produces an Apple edit copy; edit it on an iPhone, bring it back, and Rust restores the original watermark and OPPO metadata. The ordinary batch queue is not involved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不保留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支持": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不追加 OPPO 私有信息，照片可在 Apple 照片里继续编辑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds no OPPO private data; the photo stays editable in Apple Photos."
